<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  8.48%			 C/S =  ----</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.54%			 O/N =  ----</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27%			 T/N =  1.27%</p>
<p>		   Jan  21, 1997			Jan 20, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.41%	1 month forward =  4.62%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  5.77%	2 month forward =  6.04%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.79%	3 month forward =  6.83%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.04%	4 month forward =  6.99%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.26%	5 month forward =  7.17%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.25%	6 month forward =  7.23%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
